# Answer key for B9 t5_metamorphic.sql - names and resolution, metamorphic.
#
# WRITTEN FROM SOURCE BEFORE THE ANALYSER WAS RUN OVER THIS FILE.
# Conventions: all of B1-B4, plus D-23..D-25. Every node is schema-qualified (D-25).
# Pair facts are stated at spelling A; spelling B restates them with `repeat`, so the
# per-statement check covers both halves. Every relation outside a SET is qualified, so
# no search_path assumption arises in this file.

@ 18 P1A qualified
value staging.ledger.account -> mart.kpi_rollup.segment identity
value staging.ledger.amount -> mart.kpi_rollup.revenue identity
@ 25 P1B SET + unqualified
repeat value staging.ledger.account -> mart.kpi_rollup.segment identity
repeat value staging.ledger.amount -> mart.kpi_rollup.revenue identity

@ 34 P2A "amount"
value staging.orders.amount -> mart.channel_mix.revenue identity
@ 39 P2B amount
repeat value staging.orders.amount -> mart.channel_mix.revenue identity

@ 46 P3A upper case
value staging.orders.channel -> mart.channel_mix.channel identity
@ 51 P3B lower case
repeat value staging.orders.channel -> mart.channel_mix.channel identity

@ 58 P4A SELECT *
value core.ledger.id -> core.ledger.id identity
value core.ledger.account -> core.ledger.account identity
value core.ledger.balance -> core.ledger.balance identity
value core.ledger.status -> core.ledger.status identity
@ 63 P4B explicit list
repeat value core.ledger.id -> core.ledger.id identity
repeat value core.ledger.account -> core.ledger.account identity
repeat value core.ledger.balance -> core.ledger.balance identity
repeat value core.ledger.status -> core.ledger.status identity

@ 70 P5A t.*
value core.dim_carrier.id -> mart.carrier_scorecard.carrier_id identity
value core.dim_carrier.name -> mart.carrier_scorecard.carrier_name identity
@ 75 P5B explicit
repeat value core.dim_carrier.id -> mart.carrier_scorecard.carrier_id identity
repeat value core.dim_carrier.name -> mart.carrier_scorecard.carrier_name identity

@ 82 P6A USING
value staging.orders.store_id -> mart.sales_daily.store_id identity
value core.fct_order_line.net_amount -> mart.sales_daily.net_amount identity
@ 88 P6B ON, left column
repeat value staging.orders.store_id -> mart.sales_daily.store_id identity
repeat value core.fct_order_line.net_amount -> mart.sales_daily.net_amount identity

@ 96 P7A NATURAL
repeat value staging.ledger.account -> mart.kpi_rollup.segment identity
value core.ledger.balance -> mart.kpi_rollup.revenue identity
forbid filter staging.ledger.id -> mart.kpi_rollup | the shared columns are the join condition (D-5)
@ 102 P7B USING (id, account)
repeat value staging.ledger.account -> mart.kpi_rollup.segment identity
repeat value core.ledger.balance -> mart.kpi_rollup.revenue identity

@ 110 P8A three-part names
value staging.payments.method -> mart.channel_mix.channel identity
value staging.payments.amount -> mart.channel_mix.revenue identity
@ 115 P8B alias
repeat value staging.payments.method -> mart.channel_mix.channel identity
repeat value staging.payments.amount -> mart.channel_mix.revenue identity

@ 122 P9A CTE named like a table
value core.ledger.account -> mart.kpi_rollup.segment identity
repeat value core.ledger.balance -> mart.kpi_rollup.revenue identity
filter core.ledger.status -> mart.kpi_rollup
@ 130 P9B derived table of the same name
repeat value core.ledger.account -> mart.kpi_rollup.segment identity
repeat value core.ledger.balance -> mart.kpi_rollup.revenue identity
repeat filter core.ledger.status -> mart.kpi_rollup

@ 137 P10A FULL JOIN USING
value staging.orders.store_id, core.fct_order_line.store_id -> mart.sales_daily.store_id conditional
value staging.orders.amount -> mart.sales_daily.gross_amount identity
@ 143 P10B COALESCE of both keys
repeat value staging.orders.store_id, core.fct_order_line.store_id -> mart.sales_daily.store_id conditional
repeat value staging.orders.amount -> mart.sales_daily.gross_amount identity

@ 161 R1 a realistic multi-schema load
value staging.LegacyFeed.CustomerID -> mart.FeedSummary.CustomerID identity
value staging.LegacyFeed.Amount -> mart.FeedSummary.Total derived
value staging.ledger.amount -> mart.FeedSummary.Total aggregated
influence staging.ledger.account -> mart.FeedSummary.Total
note book's GROUP BY key decides each SUM that reaches "Total" (D-2).
value staging.LegacyFeed.amount -> mart.FeedSummary.total identity
value staging.LegacyFeed.Status Code -> mart.FeedSummary.Status Code derived
filter staging.LegacyFeed.created_at, core.dim_customer.is_current -> mart.FeedSummary
forbid filter staging.ledger.account -> mart.FeedSummary | book is on a LEFT JOIN's null side and its ON is structural (D-14, D-5)
forbid filter core.dim_customer.customer_id -> mart.FeedSummary | the ON is structural (D-5)
forbid value core.ledger.balance -> mart.FeedSummary.Total aggregated | staging is first on the path, so `ledger` is staging.ledger
